{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.BraneTowerIsospinBlind","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraneTowerIsospinBlind","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Card","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.t2_mirror_split_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.t2_mirror_split_zero","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraneTowerIsospinBlind.lean#L85-L88","doc":"The brane tower contributes **zero** to the mirror-nucleus split. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.t2_isobar_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.t2_isobar_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraneTowerIsospinBlind.lean#L76-L83","doc":"**Isospin-blindness (the (b)-exclusion).** Two isobars with the same strand\ncount `n` and the same Markov parameter `z` receive *identical* `T₂`.  Read\nwith `n = 3A`: tritium `(Z=1,N=2)` and ³He `(Z=2,N=1)` both have `n = 9`, so\nthe brane tower contributes the same value to each — zero to their\ndifference. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.value_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.value_eq","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraneTowerIsospinBlind.lean#L69-L74","doc":"**Closed form.** `T₂ = (n-1) • z²` — a function of the strand count `n`\nalone, derived from the Markov axiom.  No reference to the braid word survives. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.value","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.value","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraneTowerIsospinBlind.lean#L65-L67","doc":"The R-side single-generator stratum `T₂ = ∑_i z · tr_M(σᵢ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.markov_gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.markov_gen","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraneTowerIsospinBlind.lean#L63-L63","doc":"Markov axiom: every generator trace equals `z`, independent of the word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.trGen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.trGen","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraneTowerIsospinBlind.lean#L61-L61","doc":"Markov trace of each adjacent generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.z","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraneTowerIsospinBlind.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Markov parameter `z = 1/(q^{1/2}+q^{-1/2})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2.mk","kind":"ctor","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraneTowerIsospinBlind.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MarkovTowerT2","kind":"structure","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraneTowerIsospinBlind.lean#L53-L63","doc":"R-side single-generator brane-tower datum on an `n`-strand braid over a\ngeneric base ring `R`.  `trGen i` is the Markov trace of the `i`-th adjacent\ngenerator; the field `markov_gen` records the Markov axiom `tr_M(σᵢ) = z`\n(word-independent), the cited invariant of the (b)-exclusion. ","signatureChunk":0}]}